Note 1352.10            New MacKermit, MultiFinder-aware.               10 of 12
VINO::MCARLETON "Reality; what a concept!"           22 lines  15-JAN-1988 09:56
                                -< Minor bugs >-
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

    This program worked fine for me last night.  Background download
    is neat.  I wish I had the memory to take more advantage of it.
    I noticed a few minor problems.
    
    1) When a section of the terminal window is updated (because another
       window was moved or a dialog box is removed) reverse video
       characters are updated as positive video.  This might be a problem
       if reverse video characters have some special meaning.
    
    2) The transfer dialog box does not unhighlight when I switch to
       another application under multifinder.  It looks like I have more
       than one active window.
    
    3) Under multifinder, I can only switch applications by ckicking
       the right side of the menu bar and cycling through all of the other
       applications.  It would be nice if I could also pull down the apple
       menu and choose the the one I want.  I might prefer to do this
       so I can control which windows are on top.

    				MJC
